{"unit_id":"MarchLiu__dsh-rich-editor#card-zh","repo":"MarchLiu/dsh-rich-editor","commit":"92d9ba3ed51b683324ce613f4808f46bf8f9d4a8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"DSH Rich Editor 是面向 DSH 网页客户端的 Markdown 笔记编辑器，在对话输入区提供工具栏开关和编辑面板。它使用 CodeMirror 编辑草稿，并把面板与原生输入框的内容双向同步。用户可以用列表快捷编辑、查看实时 Markdown 预览、通过当前会话的发送服务提交文本，也可从原生文件选择器添加附件。草稿按会话分别保存，在面板关闭后仍可继续编辑，适合需要在对话中整理较长 Markdown 提示的用户。安装需要 DSH 网页组合及其会话、对话和界面服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:41-50","src/client/index.ts:56-123","src/client/EditorPanel.tsx:163-207"]}
{"unit_id":"MarchLiu__dsh-rich-editor#card-en","repo":"MarchLiu/dsh-rich-editor","commit":"92d9ba3ed51b683324ce613f4808f46bf8f9d4a8","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"DSH Rich Editor adds a Markdown notebook to the DSH web composer. Use CodeMirror to edit lists, preview formatting, and submit to the active conversation. Drafts sync with the native composer and persist per session; the file picker adds attachments. Requires DSH web client services.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/client/index.ts:41-50","src/client/index.ts:56-123","src/client/EditorPanel.tsx:163-207"]}
